@startuml
!include _theme.puml
title seq-02: Maintainer checks the publishers against the register (US-25)

actor "Maintainer" as dev
participant "tools/cli.ts\nmedia-register" as cli
database "data/\nmedia.json" as hand
participant "Zefix linked data\nlindas.admin.ch" as lindas
database "data/\nmedia-register.json" as gen

dev -> cli : npm run media-register
activate cli
cli -> hand : read companies with a UID
cli -> lindas : SPARQL by UID (no credentials):\nname, legal form, seat, status
alt fetch fails
  cli --> dev : status and request,\nexit 2, nothing written
end
lindas --> cli : one entry per UID
cli -> gen : write: request, terms,\nattribution, retrieved_on,\nentries as returned
cli -> cli : compare with the hand-kept companies
cli --> dev : companies whose name, legal form\nor seat differs, in liquidation,\ndeleted, or unknown UID
deactivate cli

note over dev, gen
  The command never edits data/media.json:
  the maintainer corrects it by hand, then runs npm run check.
end note

@enduml
